# Copy to .dev.vars (gitignored) for `wrangler dev` and uncomment what you need. Never commit real values.
# Deploy to Cloudflare asks for every key this file sets and will not take an empty one,
# so the optional secrets stay commented out: the button then asks for none.

# The token your devices send. Leave unset and offhand makes one on your first visit to /.
# OFFHAND_TOKEN=
# A Roma API key (Settings, Connections). Leave unset and sign in to Roma on the setup page instead.
# ROMA_API_KEY=
# Only for POST /say, the input for devices without their own agent.
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
